                <p rendition="#flush">I. <hi rendition="#italic">Minutes</hi></p>
                <p>The Council <hi rendition="#italic">approved</hi> the Minutes of their Third
                    Meeting.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">II. <hi rendition="#italic">Italo-Yugoslav Frontier</hi></p>
                <p>The Council discussed the question of the Italo-Yugoslav frontier (C.F.M. (46) 5).<anchor n="21" xml:id="d99-f1"
                    /></p>
                <p rendition="#flush">III. <hi rendition="#italic">Date of the Next Meeting</hi></p>
                <p>The next meeting of the Council of Foreign Ministers was fixed for the same day
                    (4th May) at 5 p.m./.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi>, 8 mai, 1946.</p>
